    "title": "Five lessons from the retailers redesigning commerce at scale",
    "hero": {
      "category": "RETAIL &middot; STRATEGY",
      "headline": "Five lessons from the retailers redesigning commerce at scale",
      "subtitle": "How JB Hi-Fi, The Good Guys, 99 Bikes and others approached the decisions that define a transformation.",
      "byline": "In collaboration with The Working Party",
