    "sections": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": "For enterprise retailers, transformation is rarely about changing platforms. It's about designing the architecture, operating model and technology decisions that enable the business to scale for years to come."
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": "The retailers achieving the strongest outcomes haven't simply migrated to Shopify. They've rethought how technology, teams and workflows work together to create a more agile retail business."
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": "The Good Guys successfully de-risked a billion-dollar migration in just six weeks. JB Hi-Fi grew its online business from $200 million to more than $1 billion over five years. 99 Bikes increased flexibility and customer experience while reducing custom code and ongoing complexity."
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": "These outcomes weren't driven by platform migration alone. They came from making the right architectural decisions, simplifying technology, and building operating models designed to evolve with the business."
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": "This guide brings together those lessons into a practical resource for senior retail executives responsible for digital transformation, commerce platforms and enterprise technology strategy."
      },
